while the app's touch dock is aside for one of BAR's windows (the player list's position gone below the screen then,
WG.advplayerlist_api._bardroidAway: phone-widget-gui_advplayerslist.lua.patch). The panels BAR stacks on the list go
with it, but this button pins itself to the screen's foot (its y is never under 0), so it stayed in the bottom right
corner over Settings' frame (dev phone, upright and sideways, 2026-11-19). Otherwise under the dock, as before; with no
dock, BAR's own place. Applied by the engine (BarDroidPhoneLuaDir) to BAR's file as LuaUI loads it; if a block finds no
place, BAR's own file runs.

